@title Start screen after a project was open: two ways to learn, each named and explained
@area Start
open crates/novo-tests/tests/golden/v0.1-motor-starter.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text close project
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
shot start-after-close
expect "Try the fast keys"
expect "Learn"
check_layout
